  <item>
    <title>E48. 那些让我们走不出山姆的好物分享</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b32526606e5c594009fd68</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b32526606e5c594009fd68</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Feb 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>仓储式会员超市近几年突然火遍全国，而山姆作为其中的翘楚自然拥有很多吸引消费者的特质，商品品质算是其中一个很重要的决定因素了。但是由于山姆面积大，品类多，包装大，可能会让新会员摸不到头脑或是增加试错成本。所以，这期节目我们就一起来聊聊我们觉得去山姆不能错过的一些好吃的、好用的、好玩的东西，也欢迎大家在评论区说出你的山姆必买好物！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 我们喜欢山姆的一些原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> 生鲜肉类（ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="295">04:55</a> 猪五花； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="408">06:48</a> 梅花肉； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 猪筒骨； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">09:50</a> 猪蹄； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="665">11:05</a> 牛小排； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="680">11:20</a> 眼肉薄切； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 澳洲肥牛卷（冷冻）； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="879">14:39</a> 牛上脑薄片（生鲜）； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="904">15:04</a> 牛碎肉； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> 牛横膈膜； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="996">16:36</a> 韩式烤肉） &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1061">17:41</a> 一些分装肉类的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1318">21:58</a> 生鲜冷柜中的一些小宝藏：蛤蜊、牛蛙、鲍鱼、墨鱼仔</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> 性价比之王：生鲜鸡腿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1476">24:36</a> 冷冻大虾仁是芋头离不开山姆的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1528">25:28</a> 海鲜什锦+红油冷泡汁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1645">27:25</a> 黑虎虾的正确打开方式是煎炒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1677">27:57</a> 鳕鱼颈背肉，有营养的糊弄饭必备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1711">28:31</a> 北极甜虾，一道快手又有逼格的菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1767">29:27</a> 冷冻水果的终极归宿——制作冰沙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a> 水果类（ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1968">32:48</a> 甘肃苹果； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1984">33:04</a> 网兜装的澳洲产的橘子和橙子； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2057">34:17</a> 菠萝和香蕉； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2104">35:04</a> 青芒果条）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2143">35:43</a> 干货类可以闭眼入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2176">36:16</a> 高筋面粉做中式面点比较考验技术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2215">36:55</a> 速食/预制菜类（ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2231">37:11</a> 老诚一锅羊蝎子； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> 蒜泥白肉； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2384">39:44</a> 乌冬面大踩雷； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2417">40:17</a> 卤味拼盘考验运气； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2445">40:45</a> 速食面最推荐越南米粉； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2470">41:10</a> 良工坊番茄肉酱意面； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2499">41:39</a> 鳗鱼，性价比之选； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2526">42:06</a> 世棒午餐肉； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2556">42:36</a> 沙拉鸡胸肉； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2598">43:18</a> 帕斯雀牛肉片； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2632">43:52</a> 厚炸猪排，酱料美味； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2669">44:29</a> 东北萝卜干）&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2697">44:57</a> 零食类（ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2711">45:11</a> 地瓜干； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2727">45:27</a> 苹果干； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2755">45:55</a> 果仁小欧包； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2801">46:41</a> 摩可纳速溶咖啡&amp;大象水，居家必备； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2827">47:07</a> 袋装黄桃罐头； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2865">47:45</a> 梅子多多气泡水； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2901">48:21</a> 棒棒娃麻辣牛肉； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2928">48:48</a> 黑狮甜啤酒；）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2978">49:38</a> 烘焙类（ <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2987">49:47</a> 瑞士卷和麻薯包是当之无愧的王者； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3106">51:46</a> 桂花酒酿大福&amp;榴莲大福； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3181">53:01</a> 青柠芝士； <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3231">53:51</a> 山姆烘焙最踩雷：巧克力麦芬蛋糕）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3262">54:22</a> 衣物类，山姆的隐藏性价比好物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3348">55:48</a> 厨具类也值得一逛，最新入手不锈钢盆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3366">56:06</a> 小林制药马桶清洁块 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【制作团队】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：HAHA；芋头；榴莲</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Robin</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：芋头</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：HAHA</span></p><span></span><p><span>【播客相关】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>bgm🎵：春天到万家——张也/周深</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【联系我们&amp;投稿】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>邮箱：number85lab@163.com</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>微信公众号：85号实验室</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>听友群：添加小助手微信：ClaraLIU61，备注：进听友群</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的话可以订阅我们，给我们留言互动~期待大家的到来~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64abec69dc89afb6ef5a0485/lnBj0dJiDU40GYYwvQ-rP1YYhipi.m4a" length="85784876" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:59:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnrAx68EkQkOGQHH9bvVkb3ol4QE.jpg"/>
