  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E47. 淡季去邂逅真正慢节奏的云南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6792063bd74435e4a34f547a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6792063bd74435e4a34f547a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 23 Jan 2025 09:22:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>去年随着《去有风的地方》热播，大家掀起了一场去云南“追风”的浪潮......然而，像云南这样本身就是旅行热门大ip，时常人满为患，旅行体验总是不尽如人意，而拥有圣诞假期的HAHA在错峰旅行这件事上具有得天独厚的优势！所以，让我们这些没法轻易实现淡季旅行的人跟着HAHA一起来感受一下，淡季中的云南是个什么样子吧~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 自驾出行，记得在地图上加小星星&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a> 去云南也是会有高反的可能性的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 第一次去云南选择“昆明-大理-丽江”的经典路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a> 昆明真的四季如春吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">17:24</a> 滇池是HAHA对云南的第一印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1234">20:34</a> 昆明是一个适合文艺青年city walk的城市</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1351">22:31</a> 昆明的菜市场攻略</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">27:33</a> 去西南联大和黄埔军校感受一下历史的沉重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a> 提到大理就绕不开洱海</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1987">33:07</a> 商业化的大理古城可以去逛逛北边的菜市场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2108">35:08</a> 逛洱海生态廊道的注意事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a> 来自一个不在意食物的人的大理美食推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2610">43:30</a> 相对于大理，在丽江会有更好的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2793">46:33</a> 在白沙古镇邂逅一场世外桃源般的野生音乐会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3095">51:35</a> 丽江古城里的东巴文字，古老又新鲜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3213">53:33</a> 小心，丽江的屋瓦上会有大嘴猫出现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3296">54:56</a> 人生第一次的“日照金山” &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3562">59:22</a> 玉龙雪山下的玉湖村目前还小众</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3936">1:05:36</a> 在回昆明途中路过的楚雄偶遇的神奇火锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4091">1:08:11</a> 旅行中的一些小建议 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【制作团队】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：HAHA；芋头</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Robin</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：芋头</span></p><span></span><p><span>【播客相关】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>bgm🎵：摇篮谣——斯斯与帆</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【联系我们&amp;投稿】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>邮箱：number85lab@163.com</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>微信公众号：85号实验室</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>听友群：添加小助手微信：ClaraLIU61，备注：进听友群</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的话可以订阅我们，给我们留言互动~期待大家的到来~</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/64abec69dc89afb6ef5a0485/lhvads0swZJc9UfES3QcdLqZfTl6.m4a" length="104236403" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:11:52</itunes:duration>
