  <item>
    <title>E45. 精装房的装修经验分享会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67594de117cd5416ad3b0e2b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67594de117cd5416ad3b0e2b</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Dec 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>榴莲的期房终于艰难的交房了....有过买精装房经验的人应该知道，并不像一开始想象的可以快速拎包入住，精装房交付到入住还有一个漫长的路要走...所以趁着榴莲装修的热乎劲，我们就来分享一些我们的经验和踩过的坑...</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="107">01:47</a> 现阶段期房收房的注意事项</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="177">02:57</a> 精装房需要改造的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="364">06:04</a> 关于阳台与客厅要不要打通的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 选家具时如何控制预算</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">18:23</a> 关于全屋定制的利弊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1882">31:22</a> 关于精装房的硬装部分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2089">34:49</a> 一些省钱的小Tips &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【制作团队】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：HAHA；芋头；榴莲</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Robin</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：芋头</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：HAHA</span></p><span></span><p><span>【播客相关】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>bgm🎵：楼上装修——陈柏宇</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【联系我们&amp;投稿】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>邮箱：number85lab@163.com</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>微信公众号：85号实验室</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>听友群：添加小助手微信：ClaraLIU61，备注：进听友群</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的话可以订阅我们，给我们留言互动~期待大家的到来~</span></p>]]></description>
