  <item>
    <title>E44. 一份半公共交通的青甘旅行攻略</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6746d9f78d1233fb0d7a3730</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6746d9f78d1233fb0d7a3730</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Nov 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见，小伙伴们~最近我们的播客小分队陷入了各自繁忙的工作中，播客拖更良久，这期节目录制完成也已经有一个多月的时间了，今天终于和大家见面了~这是一期芋头8月末去甘肃和青海旅行的一期声音版旅行日记，里面分享了许多她当时出行时的攻略，虽然时效性有些差，但相信小伙伴们还是能从中捞到干货~因为时长的原因，很多细节都没有讲到，如果小伙伴们有什么疑问，想了解更过细节，可以给我们留言，也可以加入我们的听友群仔细询问哦~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="179">02:59</a> 我的“青甘计划”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a> 青海众多盐湖的选湖经验分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a> 青海部分的实际路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1431">23:51</a> 行前准备</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1967">32:47</a> 兰州</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a> 兰州→张掖的火车上的景色强推</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> 关于高反的一些补充建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2330">38:50</a> 张掖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> 敦煌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2752">45:52</a> 茫崖黑独山</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2820">47:00</a> 从黑独山到茫崖路上遇见的小惊喜——雅丹地貌群</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2911">48:31</a> 茫崖翡翠湖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3014">50:14</a> 东台吉乃尔湖&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3070">51:10</a> 察尔汗盐湖</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> 可可西里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3260">54:20</a> 一些西部机场的转机Tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3302">55:02</a> 找包车司机的一些Tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 旅行中的一些“小意外”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 假期有限，拆解“青甘大环线”的一些建议 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【制作团队】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：HAHA；芋头；榴莲</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Robin</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：芋头</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面：HAHA</span></p><span></span><p><span>【播客相关】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>bgm🎵：Go Again——King CAAN/ELYSA</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>照片分享</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>甘肃博物馆的铜奔马</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi6Qg7_rlUXo4XwBeT50LpLfJgdQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>七彩丹霞</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FshTTdDm8IYWgUL382CT8njwQ188.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>黑独山（山顶视角）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmPLC3lgCnuhoDYmiTKDEtOjQleF.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>偶遇的雅丹地貌群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqX6MM1PX3Rq7_qKntV1uf4OTDE9.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>茫崖翡翠湖</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpUkNeGmqYnud_gpjE6en-GOGmWW.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>茫崖翡翠湖（无人机视角）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltU3JBg2YmY4ja4C-y574-O95Ioj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>西台吉乃尔湖（双色湖，无人机视角）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FilBbAdcXVMCpAlZAKTCuzfegdhv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>东台吉乃尔湖</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkEGXjhJbbLnUl2vC-io074niHYs.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>察尔汗盐湖</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuzWHGZx3XZ9OiWqWTwmKw8gJIKh.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>昆仑上下的青藏铁路</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi9_LjE0QFL71DpROiOLZ8f3pAoj.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【联系我们&amp;投稿】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>邮箱：number85lab@163.com</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>微信公众号：85号实验室</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>听友群：扫描下方二维码或添加小助手微信：ClaraLIU61，备注：进听友群</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvAJfDOEe8RmcjqRQPbItsJV2oSm.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的话可以订阅我们，给我们留言互动~期待大家的到来~</span></p>]]></description>
