    <title>E34. 四月分享：正是旅行的好时节</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663aeed7dec649c5f5269d40</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663aeed7dec649c5f5269d40</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 May 2024 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>春雨绿阴肥，雨晴春亦归。花残莺独啭，草长燕交飞。</span></p><span></span><p><span>四月开始，大部分地区都迎来了一年中最美好的时节，万物复苏，春心萌动，正是走出去感受大自然的好时候！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目主要和大家分享一下我们对于旅行的准备、在旅行中的小故事以及一些旅行好物的推荐，希望大家可以在我们的分享中受到一些启发~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【Timeline】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 关于旅行准备的一些闲聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1092">18:12</a> 芋头带的老年团趣事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> 我们的五一出行计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2692">44:52</a> 旅行好物推荐 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>【制作团队】</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：HAHA；芋头；榴莲</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：Robin</span></p><span></span><p><span>文案：芋头</span></p><span></span><p><span>【播客相关】</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm🎵：</span><a href="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/songDetail/003pyWoE43nHz8?songtype=0" data-url="https://y.qq.com/n/ryqq/songDetail/003pyWoE43nHz8?songtype=0"><span>河山大好-许嵩</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们&amp;投稿】</span></p><span></span><p><span>邮箱：number85lab@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>微信公众号：85号实验室</span></p><span></span><p><span>听友群：扫描下列二维码或添加小助手微信：ClaraLIU61，备注：进听友群</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh2KWqStiQTWlc-qJukgsO-Y2kkL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>公众号会定期发布播客节目相关内容，欢迎大家关注，留言与我们互动~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmp4E9YvQrwMGed9yszVzyUnCIRd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢我们的话可以订阅我们，给我们留言互动~期待大家的到来~</span></p>]]></description>
